{"id":"1571897630","kind":"answer","title":"高一生物必修一 满分100 我30多，应该怎样快速提分？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2020-11-12","updated":"2020-11-12","votes":119,"comment_count":1,"minutes":2,"chars":1060,"keywords":["间隔重复","遗忘曲线","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki"],"summary":"这个我有经验2333，我的生物在单科质检时是全市第 4 名（同分同名） 上图 生物必修一要记的东西太多了，又不像必修二那种算术+推理，所以我推荐大家试试 Anki： Anki 是什么？ Anki 是一款基于间隔效应的复习安排软件，同时还可以制作卡片类型的笔记，方便在复习的时候直接测试自己。 Anki 可以通过每次复习的反馈来安…","question_detail_html":"<p>好慌</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/429561254/answer/1571897630","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"Anki 是什么？"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"什么是间隔重复？"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"Anki 是怎么间隔重复的？"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"该怎么用 Anki 来提高生物成绩？"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"i52QrwxE\">这个我有经验2333，我的生物在单科质检时是全市第 4 名（同分同名）</p><p data-pid=\"jOT7tbjZ\">上图</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-76dd9026af1f76df0b7015eb41b19a26\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-76dd9026af1f76df0b7015eb41b19a26_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"862\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-76dd9026af1f76df0b7015eb41b19a26\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-76dd9026af1f76df0b7015eb41b19a26_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"862\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ztb5DBKh\">生物必修一要记的东西太多了，又不像必修二那种算术+推理，所以我推荐大家试试 Anki：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e1ca1eabb17a0e05f2ef6eab2d042c50_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-6e5c1de34d099110ed66674e2cd51adb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-03b7def8364292038d1010fc89cc6160_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"851\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e1ca1eabb17a0e05f2ef6eab2d042c50_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-6e5c1de34d099110ed66674e2cd51adb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-03b7def8364292038d1010fc89cc6160_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"851\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-418cc1d9a7b6c6670cc8ed1d76cd2b1a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-1987f4f713685a8ee964d3c0aa5bc481\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bac3ed71b4c486749bd64e6279be043c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"847\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-418cc1d9a7b6c6670cc8ed1d76cd2b1a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-1987f4f713685a8ee964d3c0aa5bc481\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-bac3ed71b4c486749bd64e6279be043c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"847\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-baecf7e828b7518979dc561f185b6e8f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ea2108c0297ef282ddd9d0560be62b10\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-377c81febc9f015e10867cd4c1b149b6_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"855\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-baecf7e828b7518979dc561f185b6e8f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ea2108c0297ef282ddd9d0560be62b10\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-377c81febc9f015e10867cd4c1b149b6_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"855\"/></figure><h2 id=\"sec-1\">Anki 是什么？</h2><p data-pid=\"P9NFUNWL\">Anki 是一款基于间隔效应的复习安排软件，同时还可以制作卡片类型的笔记，方便在复习的时候直接测试自己。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c889989f10e955194dccd5b9f35e6d47_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a1d728f6e3941e6a9b78a546e5d275d2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-b045d200d75a27ca36af58ab4d9adc85_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c889989f10e955194dccd5b9f35e6d47_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a1d728f6e3941e6a9b78a546e5d275d2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b045d200d75a27ca36af58ab4d9adc85_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"1bnbcEMb\">Anki 可以通过每次复习的反馈来安排下一次复习的时间（如上图）</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">什么是间隔重复？</h2><p data-pid=\"tRrm9zRg\">先认识一下<b>遗忘曲线</b></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-c749881b17c208d69ed23df6986f025f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c749881b17c208d69ed23df6986f025f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1208\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-c749881b17c208d69ed23df6986f025f\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-c749881b17c208d69ed23df6986f025f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1208\"/><figcaption>图片来源：https://www.osmosis.org/learn/Spaced_repetition</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"I0FHZGV1\">第一天，当我们翻开课本，听老师讲课，学了点东西之后，随着时间推移，我们学到的东西在记忆中的保留量将像<b>遗忘曲线</b>那样指数级<b>下降</b>。</p><p data-pid=\"CQfTfvim\">遗忘曲线大致符合下面这个式子：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"9ul4MM02\"><img alt=\"R=e^{-\\frac{t}{S}}\" class=\"math-eq\" eeimg=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=R%3De%5E%7B-%5Cfrac%7Bt%7D%7BS%7D%7D\"/><br/>R：记忆保留量<br/>t：时间<br/>S：记忆强度</blockquote><p data-pid=\"jdPp34nG\">面对遗忘我们怎能坐以待毙？看看加入复习后的效果！</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-82ab95e2513ef58851443bcb0b2c36e8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-82ab95e2513ef58851443bcb0b2c36e8_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1197\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-82ab95e2513ef58851443bcb0b2c36e8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-82ab95e2513ef58851443bcb0b2c36e8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1197\"/><figcaption>图片来源：https://www.osmosis.org/learn/Spaced_repetition</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"Z0EzEqx2\">在学习新知识之后的这段时间里，我们加入<b>复习</b>(或主动回忆)课堂内容，那么遗忘曲线将会开始<b>变平</b>，然后我们将得到<b>更多更好</b>的<b>长期</b>记忆。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-779109278b5d8292fda27c4dd65c6b89\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-779109278b5d8292fda27c4dd65c6b89_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1207\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-779109278b5d8292fda27c4dd65c6b89\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-779109278b5d8292fda27c4dd65c6b89_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1207\"/><figcaption>图片来源：https://www.osmosis.org/learn/Spaced_repetition</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"8E0wiHiG\">看到一长一短的两个间隔了吗？对于较为<b>生疏</b>的材料，我们加以<b>较短</b>的间隔，而对于较为<b>熟悉</b>的材料，我们加以<b>较长</b>的间隔。这样一来，我们就能更高效的保持更多更好的长期记忆。</p><h2 id=\"sec-3\">Anki 是怎么间隔重复的？</h2><p data-pid=\"17LQx0eJ\">给一个具体的例子吧！以我高中时使用 Anki 的经历为例：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-7d6c76590a00da74a9dbb88f3c442566\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-7d6c76590a00da74a9dbb88f3c442566_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-7d6c76590a00da74a9dbb88f3c442566\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7d6c76590a00da74a9dbb88f3c442566_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"7JjHyVpd\">这是我的一张生物卡片的学习记录，卡片的内容是下面这个</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-6906b0c118366546be1367e4ec9f5045\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6906b0c118366546be1367e4ec9f5045_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-6906b0c118366546be1367e4ec9f5045\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-6906b0c118366546be1367e4ec9f5045_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"oJswrSIA\">这张卡片对我来说有点迷惑性，所以我答错了一次，复习了13次，总共花在这张卡片上的复习时间是2分31秒。</p><p data-pid=\"3d1Et--_\">再看看另一张卡片</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-44c22d8db759cd09da297744c292a5c7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-44c22d8db759cd09da297744c292a5c7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-44c22d8db759cd09da297744c292a5c7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-44c22d8db759cd09da297744c292a5c7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"jdUZu10t\">内容是</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"lvCAC8wG\">这张卡片我记得熟，复习5次，仅花了28秒的复习时间。</p><h2 id=\"sec-4\">该怎么用 Anki 来提高生物成绩？</h2><p data-pid=\"OZU9uF7B\">Anki 的用法可以参考这篇教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acfa8f607f2d3c74ba5c660c3ab25df0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"500\" data-image-width=\"1161\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：Anki 教程(电子书)与 B 站 Ankidroid 教程(视频)快速通道</a><p data-pid=\"Wnq_uYHS\">如何制作生物牌组，可以参考我高中时制作的 Anki 生物牌组：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-117ddd1963de66d19d6e4c46bcb6c920_120x160.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1149\" data-image-width=\"800\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/38183211\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【实战】简单 Anki 生物之必修一</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-79d2a9cf052e409ae4c2f4e7d4ce64bf_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"376\" data-image-width=\"1076\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/151738322\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【解密】第1期：遗传与进化|Anki生物</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b98e1d18ac3cb922e0a0654535074091_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"533\" data-image-width=\"1181\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/166561325\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【解密】第6期：稳态与环境|Anki生物</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b98e1d18ac3cb922e0a0654535074091_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"533\" data-image-width=\"1181\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/214354261\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【解密】第10期：生物技术实践|Anki生物</a><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-b98e1d18ac3cb922e0a0654535074091_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"533\" data-image-width=\"1181\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/258438100\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：【解密】第13期：现代生物科技|Anki生物</a><p data-pid=\"KsZtQGFF\">希望对大家有所帮助！</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 3 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Osmosis from Elsevier"},{"id":"156672476","title":"艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线的错误","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"305651556","title":"间隔重复 (spaced repetition)","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":38,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2808081986","title":"如何运用心理学来学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":194,"minutes":6,"reason":"相似问答 · 194 赞同"},{"id":"1582392918","title":"学习不好要怎么复习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":25,"minutes":5,"reason":"相似问答 · 25 赞同"},{"id":"816693595","title":"高中生应该怎样记笔记？需要用什么本子？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":88,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 88 赞同"},{"id":"1330938447","title":"怎样可以让知识点记忆的更加牢固？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":92,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 92 赞同"},{"id":"3521700299","title":"如何改善高考完之后就把知识都还给学校？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":85,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 85 赞同"}]}